{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pixiescape",
    "steam_appid": 1691780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/c04f545c127bcc9e145fb243302f7e71.avif?t=1685696584\" /></div><br><br><strong>Pixiescape is an asymmetrical multiplayer game, inspired by games like hide and seek or cops and robbers, where you play as a Fairy (hiding team) or a Robot (seeking team).</strong> <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/813b8a5fb34182dd58a6346398aff14f.webp?t=1685696584\" /></div><br>While playing as a fairy, the player will be able to build enchanted mushrooms (each with their own special effects), shoot magical orbs, or use their spells to evade getting captured. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/6b93daf7958ceaddf153bfb70072760f.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/6b93daf7958ceaddf153bfb70072760f.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/6b93daf7958ceaddf153bfb70072760f.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/e3151ef3afa7dbff55a963d017e433e9.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/e3151ef3afa7dbff55a963d017e433e9.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/e3151ef3afa7dbff55a963d017e433e9.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Should the fairies get caught, they will be teleported to a jail where they can be rescued by remaining ally fairies. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cd7f3a5c2165511d697f9379e79488a4.webp?t=1685696584\" /></div><br>While playing as a robot, the player's objective is to capture all fairies as quickly as possible. Robots can choose to equip skills from a completely different set of abilities such as a grapple hook, energy orbs that smash mushrooms, a scanner to detect hidden fairies, and many others.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/c3cbe58a62c4738d8fe49c3a59cc532b.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/c3cbe58a62c4738d8fe49c3a59cc532b.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/c3cbe58a62c4738d8fe49c3a59cc532b.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Once all fairies are captured, a 2nd round will begin where the players will switch roles. (Robots become fairies, fairies become robots)<br>The second team to play as fairies must outlast the first team's time to claim victory.<br><br>Team sizes can vary:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1v1<br></li><li>2v2<br></li><li>3v3</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/a829509bc2785db0b6bf3c04674d6348.avif?t=1685696584\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Both <strong>single-player</strong> and <strong>multiplayer</strong> modes are available (however, we strongly recommend playing with friends, as this tends to enhance the experience). You can also fill any remaining spots with AI.<br><br></li><li>Take advantage of our extensive <strong>customization options</strong> to create a unique look that suits you. All items are unlockable with the in-game currency acquired from playing.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cf83b5496539468a9ce74540d6383a84.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cf83b5496539468a9ce74540d6383a84.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cf83b5496539468a9ce74540d6383a84.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>            <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/d4f322f8f2970dfa47dc2ec83e788b53.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/d4f322f8f2970dfa47dc2ec83e788b53.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/d4f322f8f2970dfa47dc2ec83e788b53.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>21 unique abilities between the two characters<br><br></li><li>6 diversified arenas to play on</li></ul>",
