erience). You can also fill any remaining spots with AI.<br><br></li><li>Take advantage of our extensive <strong>customization options</strong> to create a unique look that suits you. All items are unlockable with the in-game currency acquired from playing.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cf83b5496539468a9ce74540d6383a84.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cf83b5496539468a9ce74540d6383a84.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/cf83b5496539468a9ce74540d6383a84.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>            <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/d4f322f8f2970dfa47dc2ec83e788b53.poster.avif?t=1685696584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/d4f322f8f2970dfa47dc2ec83e788b53.webm?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691780/extras/d4f322f8f2970dfa47dc2ec83e788b53.mp4?t=1685696584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>21 unique abilities between the two characters<br><br></li><li>6 diversified arenas to play on</li></ul>",
